<title>UK: Rabobank sets 100 mln rand three-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 100 mln rand three-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.75 PCT MATURITY    03.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHERL.  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50 PCT  SELL CONC  1.0 PCT   PRAECIP     0.125 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
